  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1401.02 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1401.02 Applicability. This chapter shall apply to the owner or operator of any new, modified, or existing process or device located at a stationary source that emits a regulated toxic air pollutant (RTAP) into the ambient air, unless exempted under Env-A 1402.\n\nSource. #9601, eff 11-25-09; ss by #9865, eff 2-18-11; ss by #12443, eff 1-5-18; ss by #13334, eff 2-3-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a1400.html"
